To create an inquiry via API with prefilled parameters using a curl command, you can use the following example:\n```curl --request POST \
  --url https://api.withpersona.com/api/v1/inquiries \
  --header 'Persona-Version: 2023-01-05' \
  --header 'accept: application/json' \
  --header 'authorization: Bearer persona_sandbox_YOURAPIKEY' \
  --header 'content-type: application/json' \
  --data \"{
    \"data\": {
      \"attributes\": {
        \"inquiry-template-id\": \"itmpl_YOURTEMPLATEID\",
        \"fields\": {
          \"name-first\": \"Ruby\",
          \"name-last\": \"Lee\"
        }
      }
    }'
  }'```\n Replace YOURAPIKEY with your actual API key and itmpl_YOURTEMPLATEID with your specific inquiry template ID. This command will create an inquiry with the first name "Ruby" and last name "Lee" prefilled.
